== Reception ==
Rob Keyes of ''[[Screen Rant]]'' said, "In short, this is just a big pile of awesome for kids. For adult Marvel fans, it's still a fun watch too, especially if you have children of your own to share the experience with. There's a lot of shout outs (and a few jokes) for the fans that only adults would pick up on,"<ref>{{Cite web |last=Keyes |first=Rob |date=September 25, 2009 |title=Review: The Super Hero Squad Show |url=https://screenrant.com/review-super-hero-squad-tv-show/ |access-date=2023-07-13 |website=[[Screen Rant]] |language=en}}</ref> while Shawn S. Lealos included it in their "10 All-Time Best Animated Series Based On Marvel Comics" list.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Lealos |first=Shawn S. |date=January 15, 2022 |title=The 10 All-Time Best Animated Series Based On Marvel Comics |url=https://screenrant.com/all-time-best-animated-series-based-marvel-comics/ |access-date=2023-07-13 |website=[[Screen Rant]] |language=en}}</ref> Philip Etemesi of ''[[Comic Book Resources]]'' ranked ''The Super Hero Squad Show'' 10th in their "13 Best Animated Movies & TV Shows Featuring Black Panther" list.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Etemesi |first=Philip |date=February 5, 2023 |title=13 Best Animated Movies & TV Shows Featuring Black Panther |url=https://www.cbr.com/black-panther-great-films-animated-series/ |access-date=2023-07-13 |website=[[Comic Book Resources]] |language=en}}</ref>

